  {
    "id": 2002016010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お疲れ様です、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040020090",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ灯織\r\nなんか珍しいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0117",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1400
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっき遠くから声をかけてくれたろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもはもっと近くで声かけてくれるからさ\r\n一瞬誰かわからなかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、自覚なしか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね……？\r\nプロデューサーが少し遠かったので、先に行ってしまうなと",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、別に待ち合わせしていたわけじゃないので\r\n全然問題はないんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……なんでだろう",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう時もあるよなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は嬉しかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……え",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全然さ、無視とかもできただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気付かなかった振りとか\r\n後で『見かけた』って言うだけでも良かったのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それはそうですよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーを無視する意味がわかりません",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、そうです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010120"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0980",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、そういえばさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと企画的なことをやろうかと思ってるんだけど\r\n意見聞いてもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え、イルミネでですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう\r\nイルミネというか、うちのみんなでって感じか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええと……それ、外……というか\r\n歩きながらしていい話ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "情報漏えいとか……\r\nあと、ちゃんと腰を据えてやる話なのでは……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そもそも、相手が私でいいのかも疑問ですし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫大丈夫、ただのイベントなんだ\r\nうちだけでやることだから、もし漏れても迷惑にならない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織、そうやって色々考えてくれるだろ\r\nたたき台をさ、一緒に考えてほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n──いえ、私以外にも適任はいると思うんですが",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかもしれない\r\nでも、俺は今灯織に聞きたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、まぁこんな歩くだけの時間すら\r\n仕事をさせるなって話なんだけど……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、仕事人間ですから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私でよければ、いくらでもどうぞ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当か！\r\nありがとうな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002016010220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それで、イベントってどういうものを考えているんですか？\r\nファンに向けてってことですよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201601/2002016010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうそう\r\nツイスタを使って何かやれないかって考えてて──────",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
